WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.350
<i>The invasion of Cyfandir has begun.</i>

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.700
<i>All of this has been planned 
by the Merchant Barons,</i>

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.590
<i>who want the rights 
to the land's resources,</i>

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.190
<i>and the Inquisition, 
which is trying to hunt sorcerers.</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.510
<i>Queen Boudica and her Knights-sorcerers</i>

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:20.510
<i>invoke the assistance of past kings 
to fight them.</i>

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:25.540
<i>A battle more intense 
than history has ever seen</i>

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.180
<i>is about to shake the land.</i>

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:32.510
We have received the queen's message.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.890
For Bome!

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.760
Glory to Bome!

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.930
Ready the cannons and catapults!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.270
Fire!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.900
"I will not divide this land!"

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:54.780
The nation of Cyfandir that
 the great Merlin protected belongs to us!

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.780
Yeah!

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.540
Fire!

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.670
Massive shot incoming!

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.180
Wh-What's happening?!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.990
An anti-gravity round, eh?

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:32.270
Oh, I wish I could float, too!

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.780
The enemy fleet is on the move!

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:40.890
Enemy attack incoming! Please get back!

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.370
There is no need.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.160
Knights, clear a path!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.160
Taran!

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:53.380
Lightning, bring judgment 
upon these insolent ones!

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.420
Meltt!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.570
They were all rounded up 
in the blink of an eye!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.750
That was far too easy.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.590
There's no way 
this is all the Inquisition can do.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:35.220
Now's our chance!

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.840
The enemy commanders are wide open!

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.620
Let's move! 
In the name of the great Merlin!

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.100
In the name of the great Merlin!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.810
What? Our magic disappeared?!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.340
They're not even defending!

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.770
No matter! Continue the charge!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.150
Sciath!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:18.110
Why? What in the world is happening?!

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:20.760
We can't use Fantasia?

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.010
I knew it. That machine...

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.730
They're negating our Fantasia!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.290
What's going on?

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:52.990
The forest...

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.000
The forest!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:32.970
<b>Led to the Abyss by a Melody of Death 
-Harmonizium-</b>

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:31.650
<i>"Led to the Abyss by a Melody of Death."</i>

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.590
Lord Barell's been defeated!

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.690
They got the drop on him!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.910
Let's go!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:46.700
Yes, sir!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.320
Wait!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.570
Don't get close!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.830
If you get too close, 
your magic will—

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.790
R-Reduced to ash in a single strike...

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.310
The Thaumaturges...

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.590
But why couldn't our forces 
land the first blow?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.140
That's it! We'll attack en masse!

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:10.440
Assault the enemy forces!

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.490
No! You can't do that!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.950
That would be walking 
willingly into death!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:21.360
I can feel Fantasia being negated 
around the Thaumaturges!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.610
You can "feel" it? 
Don't be so irresponsible!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.760
It's true! We have to—

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.410
We have to stop the Thaumaturges 
as quickly as possible!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.240
Just a feeling is not enough!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.010
But—

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.020
Quiet!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.540
Is that the girl no one 
was willing to claim?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.580
Yes.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.250
Pay her no mind. 
She'll only undermine our command.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.880
Right. I will look into it.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:00.030
Don't break the line, rookie!

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:02.510
Captain! It's catching up!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.240
<i>At this rate, they'll all be...</i>

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.310
<i>This is hopeless.</i>

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:13.340
<i>I have to do something about that thing.</i>

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.890
Mordred! Sagramore!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.250
And... Lord de Gulis?!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.380
Those wannabe heroes! 
How stupid can they be?!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:27.020
Their Fantasia's going to be rendered useless!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.310
They're fast.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.700
Draccoon, I need to borrow your senses!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:35.730
Gysoni!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:45.140
<i>Meanwhile, Seth, who had succeeded 
in sneaking into the castle</i>

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.710
<i>amid the commotion at the ordination ceremony,</i>

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.470
<i>had just learned 
a terrifying secret from Diabal.</i>

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:55.840
<i>Diabal had escaped the Inquisition's torture</i>

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.660
<i>and remained in hiding to stay alive.</i>

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:04.380
Piodon handed you over 
to the Inquisition?

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.670
Why?!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:10.990
He just wants to use us 
in order to achieve his own goal.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.250
E-Even so...

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:17.930
There's no reason you have
 to hide down here forever.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.750
You could escape to wherever you wanted!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.840
Piodon can see what I see.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.580
He would know where I was.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.690
That's why...

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.930
I closed my own eyes.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:35.610
This is where I ended up 
when I ran away.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.750
The walls of this castle allow 
no outside magic through.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.330
Piodon can't find me here.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.370
So you were doing 
what those creeps told you to do

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.930
in order to keep this place safe?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:54.380
Do you realize how much the people up there 
have suffered because of you—

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.590
Don't talk as though 
you understand anything!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.670
Have you ever been tortured?!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.100
Have you ever been thrust into hell

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.750
by someone you trusted completely?!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:08.710
You're right. I've never known torture.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.740
I can't even imagine 
how much you've suffered.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:14.650
But still...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.500
Even if...

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.770
Even if the same thing happened to me, 
I wouldn't spend my life running.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.500
I wouldn't become a monster 
that attacks people to protect myself!

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:28.430
A "monster," you say?

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.100
Diabal...

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:34.030
I can trace your memories back.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:39.890
Wouldn't you like to know 
who you are... What we are?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.580
The realm of Sidh...

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.590
It's not just a legend!

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.580
It actually exists...

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:04.370
But how did you...

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.510
I did a whole lot of training.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.140
Y-You did?

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.040
But...

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:13.930
Can I really find my past here?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.770
Can I find out who I am?

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:20.050
Yeah, but it's all up
 to you from here.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.890
O-Okay...

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.820
Hey!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:29.980
N-No! I can't take any more pain!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:33.100
<i>He has a lot he doesn't 
want to remember.</i>

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.030
<i>Can't I do anything for him?</i>

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:40.510
Wait here. I'll talk to someone 
who knows this place really well.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.660
Hey! Myr!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.060
Myr!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.650
That's weird. 
He usually comes the moment I—

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.760
<i>Seth! Seth!</i>

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.060
O-Ocoho? Why are you—

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.570
<i>There's trouble! Where are you?!</i>

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.420
What's going on? 
I'm kind of busy with—

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.370
<i>It's war!</i>

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.260
Huh?

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.280
<i>War has broken out!</i>

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.460
War?!

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.980
<i>The Inquisition launched an attack on us!</i>

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.900
<i>We're holding out right now, 
but we won't last much longer.</i>

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:16.170
The enemy has greater numbers, 
and the Thaumaturges are with them!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.610
<i>What?!</i>

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.510
They were talking about you!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.250
They're looking for you!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.660
Ocoho?!

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.410
I'm okay.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.290
But I can't hold out much longer.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.670
Come quickly!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.280
Ocoho?

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.860
Hey! Ocoho?!

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.630
Diabal, we have to go!

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.210
Didn't you hear her?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.400
If the Inquisition takes over, 
this place is doomed!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.230
The... Inquisition?

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:53.790
Piodon...

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.290
Piodon will be with them!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.020
Do you want to just stay hidden forever?

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:04.070
There are two of us now! 
Let's fight together!

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.990
If you're really my brother, 
I'll protect you!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.950
You have me! Your brother!

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.690
Place that stone in the enemy camp.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:24.510
It'll summon a Spectre.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:25.840
H-Hey!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.350
Give me time 
to get a new projector ready.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:32.850
That's all I can do.

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:35.730
That's enough!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.310
I'll be back for you, no matter what!

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:41.820
That's a promise, you hear?! A promise!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:00.710
<i>War? How did that happen so suddenly?</i>

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:16.140
Boobrie? What happened?!

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:18.870
Melie?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.770
That's right! Where's Melie?

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.780
Did something happen to her?

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.380
Turn here.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.310
Is this her?

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:44.650
Yes. She's the horned boy's friend.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.450
Wha—

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:50.300
Shh. Keep your mouth shut 
and listen well.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:55.520
Understand? If you try anything funny 
or tell any lies,

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.490
Liselotte will not hesitate 
to swing that sword.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.840
The only reason you're still alive

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:06.340
is that we don't know 
where your friend is.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:12.460
<i>Are these people Inquisitors?</i>

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.950
<i>Why are they looking for Seth?</i>

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.460
In other words, you're bait.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:23.340
Let's just hope 
that little creature brings him here.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.650
Melie!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.470
Melie!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.430
Melie!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.380
Finding you was easier than I expected.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:44.980
<b>[Harmonizium] 
The Fantasia nullifying machine. 
For pixies, the disappearance of Fantasia means...</b>

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.470
What do you want?!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.740
The horned sorcerer...

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.620
What about my horns?!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.500
You're that Inquisitor from before!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.120
I'm Dragunov.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.590
I'm Seth!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.050
No, forget that!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.790
You're the one who took Melie, 
aren't you?!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.660
And it worked instantly.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.470
It's a good thing to be concerned 
about your friends.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.410
Are you trying to be funny?!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.760
Where is Melie?! I'm taking her back!

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.430
Hey! That thing's dangerous!

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.960
You dodged, eh?

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.810
You seem to have the reflexes 
of a wild animal.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.070
Huh? Was that a compliment?!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.540
It was exasperation.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.530
What'd you say, you jerk?!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.910
No, forget that! Give Melie back!

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:39.830
Is that the recklessness 
you fought with in Rumble Town?

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:43.180
I finally have you now.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.670
I have a question to ask you.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.300
I have to stand here and keep watch?

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.140
He's mocking me.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.960
He'd better not be thinking 
of doing anything dumb on his own.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.790
Did you people start this war?

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.230
Who said you could ask questions?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.450
You have no right 
to take my freedom from me.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.400
You're the one 
who'll be answering the questions.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.240
Just who are you people?

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.920
What are you after?

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:20.740
We only want to know where Radiant is.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:22.410
Radiant?

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.330
Just saying that name will corrupt you.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.970
What would you do if you got there?

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.170
We'd get rid of all the Nemesis.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:33.380
Then there'll be no more discrimination 
against sorcerers.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.390
Are you being serious?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.890
Seth is serious.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.540
That makes him a dangerous individual.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:44.690
That explains everything.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.730
No wonder the top brass 
ordered us to find him.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:57.590
You challenged Konrad to battle, 
even though you knew

00:16:57.590 --> 00:16:59.660
it would put many people in danger!

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.640
Oh, that macho guy?

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.460
Yeah, because he was pure evil!

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:09.020
I don't deny that. However,

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:13.850
at that moment, 
he was holding the entire island hostage!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.340
I saw someone 
who was making everyone else suffer,

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:21.250
and I was the only one 
who could defeat him!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.720
A ridiculous answer.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.370
Did it not occur to you

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:31.480
that one misstep would have meant 
the death of all those people?

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.490
If I'd stopped to ask that,

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.570
nothing would have been fixed!

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:40.990
I can't stand the idea 
of not doing everything I can!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:47.500
And you're a friend of this dangerous
 individual, the horned sorcerer.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.930
The fact that he has horns 
doesn't mean anything.

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:55.100
I travel with Seth because I want to, 
and that's all.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:56.510
Insolent brat.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:18:00.250
I could kill you right now. 
Doesn't that scare you?

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.100
This isn't enough to scare me.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.520
What I faced in Rumble Town 
was far more frightening.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:13.210
Then what if I told you things here 
were about to become even more frightening?

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:16.960
I'll never allow that, 
and neither will Seth!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:21.780
Do you Inquisitors believe 
you're always right, without fail?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.030
Yes, we do.

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:27.660
We are needed to bring order 
to this chaotic age.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:31.660
What you're doing is no more 
than one-sided violence!

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.870
How dare you?!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.860
If you don't realize that,

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:37.550
you must be thoroughly
 intoxicated with yourselves.

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:42.450
I'm telling you that 
I can kill you whenever I want!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.140
Hey. Get up.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.560
I told you to get up!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.690
You little—

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.180
My provocation worked!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.860
Bye now!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:03.580
Oh!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:08.350
That hat you're wearing is super cute! 
It suits you!

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:11.170
Wh-Why, you...

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:15.970
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.690
Punish this evil one!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.060
<i>I-It worked!</i>

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:27.850
<i>But...</i>

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:31.850
<i>Why did he let me get away?</i>

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:35.050
The only one I'm after 
is the horned sorcerer.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.500
<i>What is he thinking? 
He's supposed to be an Inquisitor.</i>

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.240
Just surrender quietly!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.530
Why should I?!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.580
Capturing you is my mission.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.810
If I do that, I can convince them 
to cease hostilities!

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:54.750
What?!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:58.890
But you're the ones who took Melie 
and started this war!

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:02.260
You expect me to trust anything you say?!

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:09.780
Pardon me!

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:13.460
We have suffered massive casualties, 
and the enemy...

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.870
is essentially unharmed!

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.870
We can't hold out any longer.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:20.780
What are the Knights-sorcerers doing?!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:31.500
We are honored to welcome the men 
responsible for our prosperity.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:35.230
What sophisticated, genteel behavior!

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:40.870
We were taken aback 
when our queen ordered us to meet you,

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.900
but your ship, your decorations,

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:46.760
and your demeanor are all 
the epitome of refinement!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:50.530
A quality long lost in our royal court, 
I am sad to say...

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:51.770
Your queen?

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.620
Oh, Lord de Gulis, allow me to explain.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:57.520
Huh?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:02.030
That story was made up 
in order to move things along.

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:05.410
I only borrowed the queen's name.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.250
What are you talking about, Mordred?

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:11.410
Didn't we come here 
to stop the fighting?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.660
Yes, and it's going 
just as planned, Sagramore.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:18.050
The fighting will end very soon.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.460
I see.

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:25.180
You are just as shrewd as your father,

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.430
son of mine.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:30.870
War does make my heart dance,

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:36.430
but it is a bit vexing 
when there is so little resistance.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:39.080
This has gone on longer 
than we expected.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:43.810
That queen of theirs 
is the only real challenge!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.570
Santori, we are not here to play games.

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:53.330
Indeed, indeed!

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.330
Let's increase the machine's output.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.590
The forest...

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:22.040
Jill...

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:24.200
My Jill is...

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:28.050
Jill!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:04.950
<i>Mordred is actually the son 
of the Merchant Baron Doussant.</i>

00:24:05.450 --> 00:24:08.060
<i>He has been deceiving 
his companions all along.</i>

00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:11.420
<i>Ocoho's wails echo into the sky.</i>

00:24:12.250 --> 00:24:16.260
<i>It was the Merchant Barons 
who started this war,</i>

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.370
<i>and their motive for doing so 
is about to be revealed.</i>

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:24.470
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Light of Life is Extinguished."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Light of Life is Extinguished 
-Tragedy-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Maybe I provoked her a bit too much...</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
